<title>USA: Hot, dry weather continues in W.Africa cocoa areas.</title>
<headline>Hot, dry weather continues in W.Africa cocoa areas.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, Mass. 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Weather in West African cocoa growing areas is expected to continue hot and dry to Friday, independent forecaster Weather Services Corp said on Monday.</p>
<p>Temperatures are around 90-100 degrees F.</p>
<p>The weather is likely to stress trees in the Ivory Coast, it said.</p>
</text>
